Language
HSharp

I
HSharp Joined Separate
; Documented in c-family/c.opt

fhsharp-dump-ast
HSharp Var(flag_hsharp_dump_ast)
Dump the parsed H# syntax tree to stderr.

Whsharp-unused
HSharp Var(warn_hsharp_unused) Warning
Warn about unused local variables in H# code.

